Adds a label → regex map under redaction.custom_secrets so users can
declare credential shapes for the redactor without touching pii.custom_patterns.
Wire-up to the redact engine lands in a follow-up commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
